  ('comparing-yourself-less', 210, 'Spend five minutes in the late afternoon sitting quietly and noticing what is going well.'),
  ('comparing-yourself-less', 211, 'Consider a friend''s lifestyle you envy and imagine living it for a week, including the parts you would not choose.'),
  ('comparing-yourself-less', 212, 'Write one sentence about a struggle you have overcome that most people around you know nothing about.'),
  ('comparing-yourself-less', 213, 'Think of a comparison you made today and imagine how it might look from the other person''s side.'),
  ('comparing-yourself-less', 214, 'Notice a "keeping up" pressure among neighbors or friends, and pick one way to quietly step out of it.'),
