  ('comparing-yourself-less', 309, 'When you see a friend''s travel photos, send them a sincere "Looks amazing, I hope you rested!"'),
  ('comparing-yourself-less', 310, 'List three trips or outings you would love to take, chosen only by what sounds fun to you.'),
