  ('comparing-yourself-less', 334, 'On a fall morning, sip something warm and write down one thing you are glad to be doing this season.'),
  ('comparing-yourself-less', 335, 'During the summer, notice comparisons about vacations and enjoy one local outing that suits you.'),
  ('comparing-yourself-less', 336, 'On a crisp winter evening, write a few lines about what has gone well for you this year.'),
