  ('comparing-yourself-less', 365, 'Close this challenge by writing, "My life, my pace, my values," and add one line about what that means to you.'),
  ('being-kinder-with-your-partner', 1, 'When your partner first comes into the room today, stop what you are doing, look up and greet them warmly by name.'),
  ('being-kinder-with-your-partner', 2, 'Before one of you leaves the house today, say a real goodbye with eye contact instead of calling it over your shoulder.'),
  ('being-kinder-with-your-partner', 3, 'Name one specific thing your partner did this week that made your life easier, and thank them for it out loud.'),
  ('being-kinder-with-your-partner', 4, 'Make your partner a cup of coffee or tea the way they like it, without being asked.'),
  ('being-kinder-with-your-partner', 5, 'Notice how this relationship feels for you, and know this: if it ever involves fear, threats or harm, you deserve support, and you can reach out to a trusted person or a domestic violence hotline.'),
  ('being-kinder-with-your-partner', 6, 'Ask your partner how their day went, then put down whatever you are holding and listen to the whole answer.'),
  ('being-kinder-with-your-partner', 7, 'Think of something your partner mentioned recently, a worry, a plan or a funny story, and ask them how it turned out.'),
  ('being-kinder-with-your-partner', 8, 'Leave a short note somewhere your partner will find it, saying one thing you love about them.'),
  ('being-kinder-with-your-partner', 9, 'Put your phone in another room for the first twenty minutes you spend together this evening.'),
  ('being-kinder-with-your-partner', 10, 'Take over one chore your partner usually does and dislikes, and do it quietly without pointing it out.'),
  ('being-kinder-with-your-partner', 11, 'The next time something bugs you, start with "I" and a feeling instead of "You always," and keep your voice gentle.'),
  ('being-kinder-with-your-partner', 12, 'When you feel a sharp reply coming, take one slow breath before you answer, and let the softer version come out.'),
  ('being-kinder-with-your-partner', 13, 'If your partner does something that annoys you, try out the kindest likely reason for it before you react.'),
  ('being-kinder-with-your-partner', 14, 'Catch yourself if you start counting who did more today, and let the tally go for one evening.'),
  ('being-kinder-with-your-partner', 15, 'Ask your partner what small thing makes them feel most cared for, and write their answer down somewhere you will see it.'),
  ('being-kinder-with-your-partner', 16, 'Share something that made you laugh today with your partner, and enjoy laughing about it together.'),
  ('being-kinder-with-your-partner', 17, 'Offer your partner a hug when you reunite at the end of the day, if they welcome it, and hold it a few seconds longer.'),
  ('being-kinder-with-your-partner', 18, 'Send your partner a midday message that says nothing more than that you are thinking of them.'),
  ('being-kinder-with-your-partner', 19, 'Plan a simple date at home tonight: a favorite snack, the lights low and one thing you both enjoy.'),
  ('being-kinder-with-your-partner', 20, 'Ask your partner about a goal they are working on, and ask what would help them most with it this week.'),
  ('being-kinder-with-your-partner', 21, 'Say something kind about one of your partner''s friends, and encourage them to make time to see that friend.'),
  ('being-kinder-with-your-partner', 22, 'On a stressful day for your partner, ask, "Would it help more if I listened, or if I took something off your plate?"'),
  ('being-kinder-with-your-partner', 23, 'Lower your voice by half when you disagree today, even if the topic is small.'),
  ('being-kinder-with-your-partner', 24, 'Notice one thing your partner does well as a parent, friend, worker or neighbor, and tell them what you noticed.'),
  ('being-kinder-with-your-partner', 25, 'Refill or restock something your partner uses often, before they notice it is running low.'),
  ('being-kinder-with-your-partner', 26, 'Ask your partner, "What was the best part of your day?" before you talk about anything practical.'),
  ('being-kinder-with-your-partner', 27, 'Hold your partner''s hand while you walk together or sit side by side, if they like that kind of closeness.'),
  ('being-kinder-with-your-partner', 28, 'Offer to handle one small errand on your partner''s list so they have a little more breathing room.'),
  ('being-kinder-with-your-partner', 29, 'Replace one complaint you would normally make today with a request phrased as a kind question.'),
  ('being-kinder-with-your-partner', 30, 'Tell your partner one quality of theirs you hope rubs off on you.'),
  ('being-kinder-with-your-partner', 31, 'Greet your partner in the morning with a smile and a few kind words before talking about the day''s logistics.'),
  ('being-kinder-with-your-partner', 32, 'Ask your partner to tell you about something they are looking forward to, and show real interest in it.'),
  ('being-kinder-with-your-partner', 33, 'Turn toward your partner when they share a small thought, even a comment about the weather, and respond warmly.'),
  ('being-kinder-with-your-partner', 34, 'Pick a song that reminds you of your partner and play it for them or send it to them.'),
  ('being-kinder-with-your-partner', 35, 'Warm up the car, set out their keys or pack them a snack before they head out the door.'),
  ('being-kinder-with-your-partner', 36, 'After a small disagreement today, go back to your partner and say, "I don''t want us to stay tense about that."'),
  ('being-kinder-with-your-partner', 37, 'Ask your partner a question about their childhood you have never asked before, and listen closely.'),
  ('being-kinder-with-your-partner', 38, 'Let your partner choose what you eat, watch or do together this evening, and go along with it gladly.'),
  ('being-kinder-with-your-partner', 39, 'Say "please" and "thank you" to your partner as often as you would to a guest in your home.'),
  ('being-kinder-with-your-partner', 40, 'Write down three things your partner did for you this week that you may have taken for granted.'),
  ('being-kinder-with-your-partner', 41, 'Thank your partner for one thing on that list of things you had taken for granted.'),
  ('being-kinder-with-your-partner', 42, 'Tell your partner about a moment from early in your relationship that still makes you smile.'),
  ('being-kinder-with-your-partner', 43, 'Clear your partner''s dishes along with yours after a meal without commenting on it.'),
  ('being-kinder-with-your-partner', 44, 'When your partner talks today, resist the urge to fix or advise, and simply say, "That makes sense."'),
  ('being-kinder-with-your-partner', 45, 'Ask your partner, "Is there anything on your mind I could help with this week?"'),
  ('being-kinder-with-your-partner', 46, 'Make the bed or tidy a shared space the way your partner likes it.'),
  ('being-kinder-with-your-partner', 47, 'Give your partner a sincere compliment about how they look, focused on something you genuinely like.'),
  ('being-kinder-with-your-partner', 48, 'Spend ten minutes together tonight with no screens, just talking about anything at all.'),
  ('being-kinder-with-your-partner', 49, 'Watch for a moment to say, "You were right about that," and say it gracefully.'),
